  "notes": "East-facing 55 \u00d7 80 ft courtyard home on one level. The entrance hall looks straight across the aangan to its frangipani; living and dining open to it on the south, a covered veranda on the north leads to the bedrooms, and the family lounge opens to both the aangan and the rear garden. Every room has daylight and cross-ventilation from two sides. Preliminary concept: structure, services and approvals remain with a qualified professional.",
